        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "`POST /payment/checkouts/{charge_id}/confirm` (Razorpay) \u2014 the three fields Checkout's\ncallback hands the browser. **Proof of nothing**: the server checks the signature as a\nprecondition, then asks Razorpay what happened. Missing or blank fields are a 400.",
